    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37234" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">postmŏdum</span></b> , adv.
		post-modus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>afterwards</i>, <i>presently</i>, <i>shortly</i> (mostly post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saepe ex injuriā postmodum gratiam
					ortam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					1, 9, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ne postmodum flecti precibus aut donis regiis
					posset,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					1, 9</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 2, 10</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">2, 9, 7</span></i>
			Weissenb. (al. postmodo); <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Calig. 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 2, 9, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 10</span></i>, ext. 2; <i><span class="en">Col. 1, 5,
			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 9, 17</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">6, 2, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cels. 7,
				26, 3</span></i>.</div>
